  "before_start": "Cut Formalin-Fixed Paraffin-Embedded (FFPE) tissue specimen at 4 \u00b5m thickness using a water fall microtome:\n\nHM 355S Automatic Microtome, ThermoFisher Scientific, 905200 \nSection Transfer System (STS), ThermoFisher Scientific, 771200\n\nPlace the section on a superfrost glass slide.       \n\nThe time the sections can be left in the water depends on the type of paraffin waxed used and the water temperature. \nThe lab uses paraffin wax from HistoLab Products AB, which have a melting point of 56-58 \u00b0 C and we recommend a water bath temperature of 37-39 \u00b0C. \n",
